l":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110186","id":3245051365,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Ba43l","user":{"login":"xDovos","id":116905219,"node_id":"U_kgDOBvfVAw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/116905219?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xDovos","html_url":"https://github.com/xDovos","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xDovos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xDovos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xDovos/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xDovos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xDovos/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xDovos/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xDovos/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xDovos/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xDovos/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-02T12:09:15Z","updated_at":"2025-09-02T12:09:15Z","body":"<img width=\"1861\" height=\"785\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/23931e06-93a5-4887-98f3-41eaa46c3564\" />\n\n<img width=\"2009\" height=\"790\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/363d910e-52ce-42e7-b9f1-dd4872db1bd7\" />\n\nit goes from 40 px to 24 px minimal height if i set the content margin to 0 and that seems to be the minimal height of the label inside the button as if i remove the text, i can collapse it to 0 height.\nso if i have it at -1 i get the content minimal height (24) + the texture margin (2 x 8) as minimal height.\nso with 0 it completely ignores the texture margin and with -1 it adds two minimal heights together.\ntho knowing that now, i just need to set the content margin to 0 and be good. tho it is for me unexpected behaviour","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3245051365/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3245062234","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110186#issuecomment-3245062234","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110186","id":3245062234,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Ba7ha","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-02T12:12:17Z","updated_at":"2025-09-02T12:12:17Z","body":"Button handles size based on the text yes, it adds the margin to the minimal size, I'd expect that myself","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3245062234/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"htt